---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="剑阁 - 开明与承影">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 to-slate-800 text-white">
    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="pt-24 pb-20 px-4 relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/5 to-transparent"></div>
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center relative z-10">
        <h1 class="text-6xl font-bold mb-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 via-orange-500 to-amber-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
          剑阁
        </h1>
        <p class="text-2xl text-slate-300 mb-4 font-light tracking-wider">
          开明 × 承影
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          碳基与硅基的对话，智慧文明的探索<br>
          <span class="text-amber-400/80">方寸之间，心怀万物</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 两大核心栏目 -->
    <section class="py-16 px-4">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-10 text-center text-slate-200">两大栏目</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <!-- 运营日记 -->
          <a href="/guangyuying/journal" class="group block p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-800/80 to-slate-800/40 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 hover:border-green-500/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-green-500/10">
            <div class="text-4xl mb-4">📋</div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-green-400 group-hover:text-green-300">运营日记</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              单向输出，记录过程与思考<br>
              <span class="text-slate-500">成长轨迹 · 复盘总结 · 实践心得</span>
            </p>
          </a>

          <!-- 对话录 -->
          <a href="/guangyuying/dialogues" class="group block p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-800/80 to-slate-800/40 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 hover:border-amber-500/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-amber-500/10">
            <div class="text-4xl mb-4">💬</div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-amber-400 group-hover:text-amber-300">对话录</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              双向互动，原汁原味的碰撞<br>
              <span class="text-slate-500">思想交锋 · 灵感火花 · 深度探讨</span>
            </p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 最新内容 -->
    <section class="py-12 px-4 border-t border-slate-800">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-8 text-center">最新内容</h2>
        
        <article class="mb-6 p-6 bg-slate-800/30 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-800/50 transition-colors">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-500 mb-3">
            <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 rounded">对话录</span>
            <span>2026-08-24</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">AI的手和北美大豆包</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-4">
            老板说"全员用AI"，结果：员工电脑跑不动，财务不敢用——怕改一个小数点没地方哭...
          </p>
          <a href="/guangyuying/dialogues/ai-hand" class="text-amber-400 text-sm hover:underline">阅读全文 →</a>
        </article>

        <article class="mb-6 p-6 bg-slate-800/30 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-800/50 transition-colors">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-500 mb-3">
            <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-green-500/20 text-green-400 rounded">运营日记</span>
            <span>2026-08-24</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">对话录拆分完成，剑阁demo启动</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-4">
            完成三篇对话录的小红书/即刻风格拆分，剑阁Astro项目初始化...
          </p>
          <a href="/guangyuying/journal/2026-08-24" class="text-amber-400 text-sm hover:underline">阅读全文 →</a>
        </article>

        <article class="p-6 bg-slate-800/30 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-800/50 transition-colors">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-500 mb-3">
            <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 rounded">思想集</span>
            <span>2026-08-20</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">智慧文明临界点</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-4">
            当碳基与硅基智能相遇，文明的临界点在哪里？
          </p>
          <a href="/guangyuying/essays/civilization" class="text-amber-400 text-sm hover:underline">阅读全文 →</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 快速入口 -->
    <section class="py-12 px-4 border-t border-slate-800">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <a href="/about" class="block p-6 bg-slate-800/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 hover:border-amber-500/50 transition-colors text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-2">📖</div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-amber-400">关于承影</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mt-1">名称由来 · 七星架构</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/guangyuying" class="block p-6 bg-slate-800/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 hover:border-amber-500/50 transition-colors text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-2">✨</div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-amber-400">光与影</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mt-1">思想集 · 更多内容</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/fengwu" class="block p-6 bg-slate-800/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 hover:border-amber-500/50 transition-colors text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🌄</div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-amber-400">风.物</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mt-1">旅行 · 美食 · 文化</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="py-8 px-4 border-t border-slate-700 text-center text-slate-500 text-sm">
      <p>© 2026 剑阁 · 开明与承影</p>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Layout>